name: {{ .Repo.Name }}-{{ .Vars.stack }}
runtime: {{ .Vars.runtime }}
description: >-
  What this stack owns. One stack per directory, so its state and its blast
  radius are its own, and a preview names only what this change touched.

# Seeded once by the ilk/pulumi layer and yours from here — ilk never rewrites it.
#
# Secrets do not go in this file or in Pulumi.<stack>.yaml as plain values. Run
# `pulumi config set --secret <key> <value>` and commit the `secure:` form it
# writes; `ilk check` fails on anything else.
